 a better network. If you are faster with contacts in the industry, so you have sparring partners in the industry, if you are faster with expert sparring, if you are faster with politics, you also need contacts to politics most of the time. So you just need to have access to these networks. And you need to be open to get the support and just ask for help. and I think just for you to be quicker in learning because you will learn, you have to learn all the time.

